    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE FIREFIGHT FOR OUR LIVES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wildfires are tearing across our planet, fueled not just by climate collapse but by something far darker. A greed-driven energy experiment has fractured the boundary between worlds, opening portals to realms of demons, spirits, and mythological beasts. Fire is no longer just a force of nature. It\u2019s alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835980/extras/917191c29edb9d7b27e84e4580bb0467.poster.avif?t=1753151017\" width=616 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835980/extras/917191c29edb9d7b27e84e4580bb0467.webm?t=1753151017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835980/extras/917191c29edb9d7b27e84e4580bb0467.mp4?t=1753151017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIRE FIGHT LABS - THE WORLD LEADER IN FIRE FIGHTING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amidst the chaos of 2035, Fire Fight Labs emerges as the global leader in the war on fire. From its headquarters in Hope, Canada, and led by Dr. Daunis Zaagaasikwe, the world-renowned Anishinaabeg biochemist, Fire Fight Labs retrofits the most potent war machines to combat apocalyptic wildfires.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835980/extras/1eabcb170413fe52a0589538b3e7c0db.poster.avif?t=1753151017\" width=616 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835980/extras/1eabcb170413fe52a0589538b3e7c0db.webm?t=1753151017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835980/extras/1eabcb170413fe52a0589538b3e7c0db.mp4?t=1753151017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIGHT LIKE A HERO, WIN AS A TEAM</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter you and your crew: elite wildland firefighters turned heroes, humanity\u2019s last line of defence. Team up with friends to form a hotshot crew of four specialized roles:\u00a0<strong>Crew Chief</strong>, <strong>Assault</strong>, <strong>Medic</strong>, <strong>Engineer</strong>, each with unique skills, weapons, and tools crafted to win the war on fire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835980/extras/eeb4b63c33e99db39f67a75df1d6fa22.poster.avif?t=1753151017\" width=616 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835980/extras/eeb4b63c33e99db39f67a75df1d6fa22.webm?t=1753151017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835980/extras/eeb4b63c33e99db39f67a75df1d6fa22.mp4?t=1753151017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE FIREBASE IS YOUR PERSONALIZED GARRISON</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your Firebase is more than a home base\u2014it's your evolving stronghold in the fight against the apocalypse. Customize it to reflect your style and strategy: unlock helicopters, aircraft, and vehicles.\u00a0Build firefight-ready drones and robots, and craft elite weapons and gear using rare resources you extract from the field. Every mission feeds your progression\u2014upgrade essential base services, master powerful trade skills, and build specialized equipment on your Gunbench and Saw Bench. Hire a crack ground crew to boost tactical support on the fireline, add a gym to improve your fitness level, or upgrade your catering to finally escape the gastrointestinal nightmare of the Creamy Spinach Fettucine MREs. Train your dog to herd goats like a pro\u2014or play fetch while your friends gear up. Rally your crew, pick your next fire on the mission map, and jump into the hellfire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835980/extras/2fb64adac56d10c0f5757bc3901af27b.poster.avif?t=1753151017\" width=616 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835980/extras/2fb64adac56d10c0f5757bc3901af27b.webm?t=1753151017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835980/extras/2fb64adac56d10c0f5757bc3901af27b.mp4?t=1753151017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A GLOBAL ADVENTURE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse our planet, face firestorms born of legend, battle zombie fires raging year-round, rescue lions stuck in burning sycamore trees, save civilians and wildlife, defend towns, infrastructure, sacred and cursed lands.\u00a0Fight shoulder to shoulder with your crew to reclaim humanity's future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835980/extras/a918efabc41c68a95c2649027be07616.poster.avif?t=1753151017\" width=616 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835980/extras/a918efabc41c68a95c2649027be07616.webm?t=1753151017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835980/extras/a918efabc41c68a95c2649027be07616.mp4?t=1753151017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIRE FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One to four player class-based co-op</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-driven wildfires on a massive scale</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jetpack locomotion and\u00a0weaponized fire suppressants</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle otherworldly demons and mythical beasts from the lore of the land</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fixed-wing and rotary air support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Droids, drones, and rugged wildland firefighting vehicles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect rare resources to craft the best weapons, armour, and gear</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your Firebase to unlock capabilities and equipment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play fetch with your dog =)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>YOU WIN BY SAVING.\u00a0THIS GAME IS FIRE.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835980/extras/44a3dac2dcfe72929948a4937cdb5982.poster.avif?t=1753151017\" width=616 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835980/extras/44a3dac2dcfe72929948a4937cdb5982.webm?t=1753151017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835980/extras/44a3dac2dcfe72929948a4937cdb5982.mp4?t=1753151017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
